      "local_changes": "Compose source, tokens, preprocessor and symbols objects per context; close partial graphs on failure; use typed local-string cleanup before diagnostic jumps; update the source cursor through its explicit context; retain compiler algorithms and diagnostic semantics. Compose expressions object and borrow its aligned workspace; unwind failures and close it before symbols. Compose scopes object and borrow its inline workspace; close it before expression and symbol storage."
