      "sha256": "f374c0db142cf52c2f4db47b56bfeac18645a4cbbd0f4fe1e1fda3b924325f1b",
      "local_changes": "Use source, token and preprocessor contracts; extract strings and token-stream descriptors as structs and constant payload as union neocc_value; remove migrated global state declarations, including the five symbol stack heads and scope counter, and legacy aliases; preserve token numbering and ABI types. Extract semantic symbol/type and attribute records as structs, preserving layout and removing Sym/CType typedefs. Extract neocc_expression_value and expressions workspace, removing SValue, vtop and canonical type globals. Add per-context scopes object and workspace pointers.",
