      "local_changes": "Use tokens VO for interning/arena storage, preprocessor VO for macro stream stack operations and symbols VO for macro definition/parameter stack and token links; borrow per-context token/value, source cursor, debug indentation, working strings, character table, modes and counters; reset working references before arena release; retain preprocessing algorithms.",
