      "sha256": "1a26ca7a7090ce6e43b6af3056cf7d81633283b298850fded2510579749c73f6",
      "local_changes": "Query borrowed tokens through VO instead of accessing a global identifier table; use the per-context preprocessor token/value and source cursor; keep semantic and code-generation algorithms. Move symbol blocks, reuse chain, five stack heads and scope level into symbols object; push/copy/move/drop and reset via VO after token-link cleanup; remove global pools, stacks, scope counter and SYM_DEBUG allocation branch. Move expression array, sentinel, top and canonical types to expressions object; borrow workspace via VO and reset all value/type references before symbols reset; retain stack capacity and direct generation algorithms. Move full scope frames, current/loop/root pointers and cleanup/pending-goto chain heads to scopes object; enter/exit/reuse/reset via VO, retain short symbol-boundary snapshots and original VLA/cleanup/goto emission algorithms; reset after switch/label cleanup and before symbol storage.",
      "additional_derivatives": [
        "src/objects/symbols.c",
